{"c":[{"name":"20261016T013256Z-cf0800ebabd19f13","text":"Cults updateCreation schema defaults currency to EUR and openPriced to false, and downloadPrice to null. Omitting downloadPrice still fails with Price must be >= 0.5 (run 38835243248), so omission does not mean free on update.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261016T013603Z-56cd1932a8c14a46","text":"Cults updateCreation without downloadPrice fails 'Price must be >= 0.5' even with only id (probed live 2026-10-16). downloadPrice 0 succeeds and the listing stays free. A free update must send downloadPrice 0.","type":"note"}]}
